        {
          "question": "e-5557",
          "field": null,
          "attribute": "question/problem",
          "value": "Let $\\mathbf{u}$ and $\\mathbf{v}$ be vectors such that $\\Vert \\mathbf{v} \\Vert = 6$ and $\\Vert \\mathbf{u}+4\\mathbf{v} \\Vert = 25.$  If $\\mathbf{u}$ is orthogonal to $\\mathbf{v},$ find $\\mathbf{u}\\cdot\\mathbf{u}.$",
