      "category": "ma_capture",
      "authoring": [],
      "source": [
        {
          "question": "e-5558",
          "field": null,
          "attribute": "question/worked-solution",
          "value": "Using the triangle inequality, we have that\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}\u2016u+3v\u2016 & \\le \u2016u\u2016+\u20163v\u2016.\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nSimplifying and substituting in the given information, we get\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}\u2016u+3v\u2016 & \\le \u2016u\u2016+3\u2016v\u2016 \\\\ 14 & \\le \u2016u\u2016+3(2) \\\\ 14 & \\le \u2016u\u2016+6 \\\\ 8 & \\le \u2016u\u2016.\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nTherefore, the minimum possible value of $\\Vert \\mathbf{u} \\Vert$ is $8.$",
          "category": "ma_capture",
          "file": "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture-workers/differential/14040753/example-5558.json",
